00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,360
Read a simple A1 library article.

2
00:00:03,260 --> 00:00:07,900
Learn what libraries offer, how to get a card, and how to borrow and return books.

3
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:09,600
Warm-Up Questions.

4
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:12,380
Do you go to libraries?

5
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:15,540
What can people do in a library?

6
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:19,320
Do you borrow books or read online?

7
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:21,080
At the library desk

8
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:22,360
Hello.

9
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:23,940
I want a library card.

10
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:24,940
Sure.

11
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:26,260
Do you live near this library?

12
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:27,560
Yes.

13
00:00:27,580 --> 00:00:28,500
Here is my address.

14
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:29,940
Thank you.

15
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:31,460
May I see your ID?

16
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:34,420
Here is my ID card.

17
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:35,380
Great.

18
00:00:35,860 --> 00:00:37,220
Your library card is ready.

19
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:39,300
Can I borrow this English book?

20
00:00:39,540 --> 00:00:40,240
Yes.

21
00:00:40,740 --> 00:00:43,060
I will scan your card and the book.

22
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:45,500
When is it due?

23
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:46,360
It is due in two weeks.

24
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:48,400
Where do I return it?

25
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:52,180
You can return it at this desk or in the return box.

